<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">2Phixiroosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phixiroosa xaafeezay Nam77intho Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Phixiroosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Phix.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phixiroosa Xaafeez Nam7intho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Phixiroosa xaafeez nam7intho kiitay xaafintteezay, duma duma aqo yez binii ammaniza asayisii. Yha kiitayis aafe qofay, worddo asitamaaritay iita oosonnee u timirttaypp denddeezayid medhintteez yeellathiza yessa ixxoday garkkesii. Ye medhintteez metita kayodayis oge maaqqodayisi, Yesuusana fa aafer be7eez asaynnee E taamarssiza wode fa hayayir si7eez asitay taamarsseez timirttay baggar Xooss bazinnee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga ammanthiza eratith demo. Xaafay miinthii odeezay, «Kiristtoosa nam7intho ye7ooya» yeegiz worddo timirttay bagga. Ye qofa miinthii odittar, «Kiristtoosa maaqqii ye7ekka gam7eezay, as ubbay fa nagaraypp maaqqoday garkkepp attin oonkka dhabod garkk koyowa gishosi» yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">2 Phixiroosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtanitay xeeginttith <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Worddo asitamaarita <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa nam7intho yi7itha <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaarennee E ayllay, taanii, Simoon Phixiroosa, nu Xoossannee nuna ashshiza Yesuus Kiristtoosa xillotith baggar nuussay garkk al7o ammano ekkodayis yha dabddaabba xaafeeza.<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Xoossannee nu Goda Yesuusa eror aadho keehetithinnee saro yinttis gaanggo.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss xeessinnee dooro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Fa bonchchorannee haayotithar nuna xeegeez eza eror de7osinnee Xooss ufayssiza yess yezodayis koshshiza baz ubba Xoossii fa wolqqar nuus inggeeza. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>E bonchchayidannee E keehatithayid bonchcho gate yez ubbapp gita maaqqeez ufayis denggeeza, yhayttitay baggar yi iita amopp dendeezi yha alamel yez dhabopp buutii Xoossatith hana shaakintteeza. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Yeypp kaallii yezitay yinttis gujinttoday garkk miinggoytta, yi ammanayil afa lo77otithi, lo77otithal afa eratithii, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>eretithal afa fana moodo, fana moodithall afa garzho, garzholl afa Xooss ufayssiza yess, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>Xooss ufayssiza yessal afa ishetith qadhe, ishetith qadheel afa siiqo gujjoytta. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Yeyitititay yinttis gaanggii yeza baz maaqqiko, Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa eror maaddiza asinnee aafe aafiz as yinttan udoda. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Zini yeyititay baa oonkka kantta yeza baz aadda bi7iz to7a. E fa tiina nagaraypp geezheezana dogeeza.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Yeyi gishos, ta ishuntho, yi xeessanne yi doorintta minthodayis kaseesaypp aathii miinggoytta. Yi yeyititta oothizabaz maaqqiko, dhubinttaamii. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Ezayid nu Godanne nuna ashshiza Yesuus Kiristtoosa medhina kaatetitha gelo kunthetithar yinttis ingginttoda.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Yeyi gishos, yi yhayttita eriza bazinnee yi aykkeez tumayid miinggii yeza baz maaqqikokka, taanii yhayttita ubba wode yinttan qofiso ashshaamii. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Taanii shemppor yezeez wode ubbayid yinttan qopisoday beeziza baz gi ta qoppiza. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa taas qoncciseezaygarkk taanii yha yhayqqiz asha gam7ekkazar qaar olii yhammadana eriza. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Taanii yhatti butinttizay ta yinttipp yhayqqii shaginttikokka yi yhayttita ubba wode akaakod garkk taas danda7intteezibaz ubba udoda.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirissttoosa bonchay aafe markka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Nuunii Goda Kiristtoosa wolqqannee e yi7ithi bagga yinttis odeezay, E gita deeta nu aafer bi7ipp attin medhdhii kesseez tosse baaya. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>«Taanii ufayttiza, ta dosiza na7a yhaya» yeegiz qaalay wolqqama bonchchaypp ye7eez wode Xooss Adaypp bonchchonnee galata ekkeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mat. 17:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mar. 9:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luq. 9:28-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Nuunii ezar wolla geeshsha ambal yezar ye qaala giirth salopp ye7odar si7eeza.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Nuus yeypp aadhiz ammanintteez tinbbite qaala yeza. Sa7a wonttod gathonnee bakkala xoolintto yi wozinayid dolod gathosi, dhuma gancce poo7iza poo7ayis naaginttizay garkk, yi ye qaala naagiko lo77o udiza. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Ubbapp tiinatii yhaya eroytta. Geeshsha Maxaafayid xaafintteez tinbbite qaala oonkka fa doseezay garkk billodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Tinbbite ubbay yesha as shener odinttekkaya. Zini tinbbite Geeshsha Ayyanay kaalitheez asay Xoossii kiitteez asitay, odeezaypp attin.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Worddo asitamaarita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Zini worddo nabitay tiina asay gancce yezay garkk yhattekka worddo asitamaaritay yi gancce yessada. Unttii fana wozeez, Goda kaddii, dhabisiza worddo timirtta ko7oda. Ezayid unttii faal afa ellisii dhabo ki7iza. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Gaame asay yeellathiza u iita oga kaalloda; unttapp denddeezayid tuma oge cazhinttoda. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Worddo asitamaaritay miishe yaari paas medhdhii kesseez tosser yinttan bonqqoda. Binipp ayikkii unttis pirdday giigii betteeza; u dhabaykka unttan naagii betteeza.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Nagara ootheez kiitanchchitayis Xooss qadhinttekkazar, pirdda gallas hellodayis gaanname dhuma olla unttan accii oleeza. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Yey garkkekka, Xooss xillotith baz odiza Nohennee hara laappun asita qurii ashsheeza, Xooss goynnowa asay yez binii alama qadhinttekkazar dhabo haathar dhabiseeza. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Xooss goynnowa asayis aaziso maaqqoday garkk Xoossii Soodomennee Gamoora katamita budo udii xuuggii dhabiseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Medhe. 6:1—7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Higges kiitinttoowa wushumiza asitay gancce waayttar yezeez geesh Looxena Xoossii ashsheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe. 19:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Ye geeshsha athay u gancce yezar, unttii oothiza iita oosa gallas gallas be7eez wodennee si7eez wode e lo77o wozinay un77inttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Medhe. 19:1-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Yeya maaqqiko, Goday, fana goynniza asita paacepp wayizii ashshodazako, ma nagaranchchita pirdda gallas hellodayis wayizii seerittar naagisodazako eriza. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Ubbapp aathii tuna amor asho qofal kaallizitannee bonchcho yez mawute adita leqqizita, pirdda gallas hellodayis Goday naagiseeza. Ye asitay ganjje minonnee otoranchcho maaqqeez gishos salo medhetithita cazhittar yashittooya.<verse eid="2PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Zini kiitanchchitay worddo asitamaaritayppe wolqqarannee minotithar lo7ithii aadhiza zin Goday tiina salo medhetithita cazhooya. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Zini ye asitay fa eroowa baz gancce gelii cazhiza. Unttii aykinttodayissinnee yhayqqodayis yelintteeza, wozina baa do7a garkk haniza; unttikka wora do7a garkk cer dhaboda.<verse eid="2PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Unttii qoheez qohay garkk mahii qohinttoda. Seeta gallas qayxinttitar aqopp aadhii guppitar ufayssiz abaz gi qoppiza. Unttii kawushshitannee tunita maaqqii yezar yinttar shaginttiza siiqo imato ufayttiza. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Lagite maachchch bi7ii ashshowa aafe unttis yeza; ma nagara oothiza ashshooya. Ammanor minggekka asa dooshiza. Unttis ubba wode amottiz wozina yeza; unttii baadintteezita. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>U luule oge ashshii, iita oothii miishe qadhdhii balintteeza, Bi7oora na7a Balaama oga kaalleeza. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>E fa nagara denddeezayid geeza; ododayis danda7oowa hare as garkk nashshi nabe eyatititha teqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Tay. 22:4-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Ye asitay meleez pultto garkkennee carkko tookkii kanggiza shaaradhonnee garkk; unttan naagizay linxxi geez dhuma. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Unttii cerenee utira oda odinttinttar buutar yez asay ganccepp kessii ekkii haga minggekka asita lagita asho amor dooshshii balthiza. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Unttii paas dhabo aylletitha yezar yhankkita, «Yi aylletithapp kezoda» yeegiza. Abis giiko, asii fana gameez baz ubbayis aylle. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Unttii ashshiza nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa erii yha alama tunatithapp buutteezayppe guye, maaqqii ayikinttii gaminttiko tiina yez yessayppe guyeesay unttis iita maaqqoda. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Unttii xillotithi oge erii maaqqii ashshizaypp tiinattii geesh kiitta erekkazako unttis lo77ozin. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>«Kana fa cooshshiko guye maaqqiza» ma, «Meecintteez gudunthay guye maaqqii urqqa goli7ali7iza» giz aazisay tuma maaqqeezay unttal afa haneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Aazi. 26:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday yi7ith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Ta siiqo ishuntho, yhayi ta yinttis xaafeez dabddaabbe nam7intho kiita. Taanii yha nam77ii dabddaabbitakka yinttis xaafeezay, yi luule qofa qoppod garkk yinttan denthithodayisii. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Ma geeshsha nabitay binii odeez qaalannee nuna ashshiza Goday, hawaaritay baggar kiitteez kiitta yi qopoday garkk koyiza. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Ubbapp tiinatii, wode wurssitha fa amo kaallii as toochchizitay ye7odana eroytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Yih. 18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>Unttis, «Goda Yesuusa yi7iza gi inggeez ufayis qaalay aba yenee? Nu aditay yhayqqeeza, zin ubba baz sa7a medhintteezaypp aykkii yezay garkk yeza» yeegiza. <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Gaame wodepp tiina salay Xooss qaalar medhintteeza; ma sa7a haathappennee haathar medhintteezana erittar kaddiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Medhe. 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Ye wode yez alamay haathar mitinttii dhabeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Medhe. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Zini yhatt yez salaynnee sa7ay, Xooss goynnoozitay pirddinttiza gallasinnee dhabod gallasay hellodayis ye qaalayir tamas naaginttii yeza.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Zini ta siiqo ishuntho, yinttan maaqqiko Goday kale pettii gallasii mukule layth maaqqeezannannee mukule laythi pettii gallasa maaqqeezana yha pettii baz dogippatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Maz. 90:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Pettay pettay gam7eeza gi qoppizay garkk, Goday fa ufayss qaalay gishos gam7enna. Zini oonkka dhabaamay garkk koyii, ubbay fa nagarapp maaqqoday garkk yi gishos gi garzhiza.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Zini Goday gallasay kayizo garkk ye7oda. Ye gallas salitay wolqqama guumthar dhaboda; salo medhetithitay tamar xuuginttoda; sa7annee sa7all afa yez ubbay dhaboda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luq. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes. 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Wan. Qon. 16:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Yikkee, ubba baz yey garkk hanii dhabiza baz maaqqiko yi waayadayis beezee? Yi geeshshinnee Xooss aaziza yess yezodayis beeziza. <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Yi yi7ith Xooss gallasa laamothannee eller helloday garkk xillotith ootho oothoytta. Ye gallas salonnee ezayid yeza baz tamar xuuginttoda; wolqqama mishar til7oda. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Zini nuunii xillotithi yeziz oroth salonnee oroth sa7a Xooss ufayss qaalar naagiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa. 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Wan. Qon. 21:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Yeyi gishos, ta siiqo ishuntho, nu ye gallasa naagiza gishos Goday yi borssonnee boro baazita maaqqii, saror yezin denggoday garkk miinggoytta. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Goday gam7eezay yi attoday garkk maaqqeezana dogippatte. Ma nu siiqo ishay, Phawuloosa, Xooss ees inggeez ecetithar yhay garkk yinttis xaafeeza. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>E fa xaafeez kiitita ubbayid yeyititay baz xaafeeza. E xaafeez kiititay gancce akaakodayis waayisiza qofitay yeza. Tamaarekannee minggekka asitay hara Xooss qaala mirqizitay garkk yha kiititakka dhabisodayis machchii mirqiza.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Yeyi gishos, ta siiqo ishuntho, yi yeya tiina eriza gishos zhucitay balithayir dooshinttii, dhabaamay garkkennee miinggii yez aqaypp pokkaamay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Ubbarakka yi nuna ashshiza nu Goda, Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithayirannee eratithar diccoytta. Ees yhattekka medhinaskka bonchcho maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
